  mitazalimab: "Mitazalimab is an antibody from Alligator Bioscience that is being tested in a phase 2 trial for pancreatic cancer.",
  mitobronitol: "Mitobronitol was a Hungarian tablet used in Europe from the 1960s to control chronic myeloid leukaemia and polycythaemia, until newer drugs such as imatinib took over.",
  nedaplatin: "Nedaplatin is a Japanese platinum chemotherapy, approved there in 1995, that is gentler on the kidneys than cisplatin and used for head and neck, lung and cervical cancers.",
